 "text": "उत्‍तराखण्‍ड सरकार\nGOVERNMENT OF UTTARAKHAND\nनिदेशालय कोषागार, पेंशन एवं हकदारी, उत्‍तराखण्‍ड\nDirectorate of Treasuries, Pension and Entitlements, Uttarakhand\nSearch\nSearch\nHome\nAbout Department\nDirectory\nCitizen’s Corner\nDocuments\nGovernment Orders\nUFS\nNotices\nPublications\nHome\nFrequently Asked Questions(FAQs)\nFrequently Asked Questions(FAQs)\nQ. What is Digital Signature Certificate(DSC)?\nDigital Signature Certificates (DSC) are the digital equivalent (that is electronic format) of physical or paper certificates. A digital certificate can be presented electronically to prove one’s identity, to access information or services on the Internet or to sign certain documents digitally. Encryption Certificate allows for secure encryption of data by verifying the identity of the sender and providing a public key used to decrypt the information. More about DSC\nQ. What is AADHAR based eSign (DSC)?\ne-Sign offers on-line platform to citizens for instant signing of their documents securely in a legally acceptable form. More about eSign\nQ. What is emBridge Signer?\nA software tool provided by eMudhra that allows users to securely sign digital documents using their hardware tokens (like USB cryptographic keys or smartcards) directly within web applications. More about emBridge Signer\nQ. What are the methods of submitting Life Certificate?\nPensioners of the state can submit their life certificate in physical form by visiting any treasury of the state. They can also submit it through other digital mediums like Android mobile app/ Public Service Center (CSC)/ Postman of the Postal Department.\n\nStep by Step Guide for Jeevan Praman System (File Size:560KB)\n\n\nQ. How to overcome the deficiencies found in online e-pension forms?\nA compiled document containing answers to frequently asked questions based on deficiencies in pension forms.\n\nFAQ for Deficiencies found in online e-pension forms (File Size:225KB)\n\n\nUseful Links\nFeedback\nWebsite Policies\nContact Us\nHelp\nWeb Information Manager\nSitemap\n\nContent Owned by : Treasuries, Pension and Entitlements, Uttarakhand\n\nDeveloped and hosted by National Informatics Centre, Ministry of Electronics & Information Technology, Government of India\n\nLast Updated: 09.01.2026",
